  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 20-layer planar dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Materials: alternate HfO2 and SiO2 starting with HfO2 at air interface. Initialize all odd layers (HfO2) at thickness = 550/(4*n_HfO2) nm and all even layers (SiO2) at thickness = 550/(4*n_SiO2) nm using material registry refractive indices at 550 nm. Optimization bounds: each layer thickness ±40% from initialization value. Use gradient_thickness optimizer with max_evaluations = 5000, multi_start_count = 20. Objective: maximize weighted sum of (average transmittance 1530-1565 nm) and (average reflectance 400-700 nm) with equal weights. Normal incidence, unpolarized light. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates, tightest_margin, and thicknesses_nm for all valid candidates. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Total layer count <= 30.",
